  :Database Schema Inference;
  note right
    :SQL Schema Generation|
    **Reverse Engineering:**
    ```python
    def generate_database_schema(bpg):
        schema = DatabaseSchema()

        # Generate tables from entities
        for entity in bpg.entities:
            if entity.type == 'DataEntity':
                table = Table(
                    name=entity.name.lower(),
                    columns=[Column(attr.name, infer_sql_type(attr))
                            for attr in entity.attributes]
                )
                schema.add_table(table)

        # Generate foreign keys from relationships
        for relation in bpg.relations:
            if relation.type == 'References':
                fk = ForeignKey(
                    from_table=relation.source.name,
                    to_table=relation.target.name,
                    confidence=relation.confidence
                )
                schema.add_foreign_key(fk)

        return schema
    ```
  end note

