' Evaluation Metrics Details
legend bottom
  **Detailed Evaluation Metrics:**

  **Cross-View Linking Metrics:**
  • Entity Linking Precision = Correctly linked pairs / All linked pairs
  • Entity Linking Recall = Correctly linked pairs / All true pairs
  • Cross-View Consistency = Same entity same attributes across views
  • Cluster Purity = Homogeneity within clusters
  • Adjusted Rand Index = Similarity to ground truth clustering

  **BPG Construction Metrics:**
  • Relationship Precision = Correct relations / Inferred relations
  • Relationship Recall = Correct relations / True relations
  • Schema Accuracy = Correct table/column mappings
  • Attribute Type Accuracy = Correct data type inference
  • FK Precision = Correct foreign keys / Inferred foreign keys

  **System-Level Metrics:**
  • Processing Speed (entities/second)
  • LLM Token Usage (tokens/entity)
  • Memory Usage (RAM/screenshot)
  • Scalability (performance vs dataset size)
end legend

